        "chapter_1": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "number": "01",
            "title": "Oberndörfer × Trax NYC",
            "text": "<p>For Trax NYC, a custom jeweller in Manhattan’s Diamond District, we made four cases in full-grain calf, lined in red Alcantara, with solid brass galvanised in gold: a jewellery box, a necklace trunk, a briefcase and a mini trunk. One example of each.</p>",
            "link_label": "See the collaboration",
            "link": "shopify://collections/oberndoerfer-traxnyc"
          }
        },
        "chapter_2": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "number": "02",
            "title": "Oberndörfer × Miramare Palace Sanremo",
            "text": "<p>After living with our pieces, the Miramare Palace in Sanremo asked us to make its new furniture: sofas, armchairs, poufs and a trunk turned into a table, in full-grain leather with solid brass in palladium.</p>",
            "link_label": "Art of Living",
            "link": "shopify://pages/oberndorfer-x-miramare-sanremo"
          }
        },
